OBJECTS
──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  Rectangle { }             Basic visual element
  Text { }                  Display text
  Item { }                  Invisible container
  MouseArea { }             Mouse interaction
  Image { }                 Display image


PROPERTIES
──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  id: object                Object identifier
  width: 100                Set width
  height: 100               Set height
  visible: true             Visibility
  opacity: 1.0              Transparency
  color: "..."              Color


ANCHORS
──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  anchors.fill: parent      Fill parent
  anchors.centerIn: parent  Center in parent
  anchors.left: parent.left
  anchors.right: parent.right
  anchors.top: parent.top
  anchors.bottom: parent.bottom


TEXT
──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  text: "Hello"             Set text
  font.pixelSize: 20        Font size
  font.bold: true           Bold text
  horizontalAlignment: Text.AlignHCenter
                              Center horizontally


SIGNALS
──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  onClicked: { }            Mouse click handler
  onPressed: { }            Mouse press handler
  onReleased: { }           Mouse release handler


COMPONENT LIFECYCLE
──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  Component.onCompleted: { }
                              Run when component loads


DATE / TIME
──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  Qt.formatDateTime(
      date,
      "hh:mm"
  )

  Common:
    "hh:mm"
    "hh:mm:ss"
    "yyyy-MM-dd"
    "MM/dd/yyyy"
    "ddd MMM dd"
